.TH rayscan-scripts-search 1  "search " 
.SH NAME
rayscan\-scripts\-search \- Search a remote script pack registry index
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsearch\fR [\fB\-\-registry\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIQUERY\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Search a remote script pack registry index
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-registry\fR \fI<URL>\fR
JSON registry index URL (or set RAYSCAN_SCRIPT_REGISTRY)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit machine\-readable JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIQUERY\fR]
Case\-insensitive filter matched against pack name, description, and tags
